{%- comment -%}
  /llms.txt: what the site is, for AI assistants and answer engines (DS-166), in the
  llms.txt form: a title, a summary, then lists of links. It replaces Shopify's own file at this
  address only. /agents.md keeps Shopify's, which tells shopping agents how to buy, and this file
  points to it.

  Shopify renders this template without a layout and without the store's objects: shop, pages,
  metaobjects and menus are blank here. Theme settings, the locale file, snippets, request and
  the agents object work. So:

  - The address, hours and admission come from Theme settings, Gallery details, as the footer
    and Plan your visit do, and change with them. The summary is the home page's description.
  - The words are in the locale file, under llms.
  - The pages are named by their addresses, typed here. check_answers.py checks that each one
    answers.
  - No telephone number or email: Shopify asks that this file holds none, since it is cached
    widely.

  Theme Check doesn't know the agents object yet, so its warning is turned off here.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- # theme-check-disable UndefinedObject -%}
{%- liquid
  assign site = agents.store_url
  assign name = 'general.site_title.gallery_full' | t
  assign address = settings.address | newline_to_br | strip_newlines | replace: '<br />', ', '
  capture hours
    render 'gs-open-hours'
  endcapture
  assign hours = hours | strip | replace: '<br>', ', ' | replace: '<br />', ', '
  assign admission = settings.admission | newline_to_br | strip_newlines | replace: '<br />', ' '
  # The days the gallery is closed when it would otherwise be open (gs-closures, DS-191).
  capture closures
    render 'gs-closures'
  endcapture
  assign closures = closures | strip | split: '|' | join: '; '
-%}
# {{ name }}
{% if settings.home_description != blank %}
> {{ settings.home_description | strip_newlines }}
{% endif %}
## {{ 'llms.visit' | t }}

- {{ 'llms.address' | t }}: {{ address }}
{% if hours != blank -%}
- {{ 'llms.open' | t }}: {{ hours }}
{% endif -%}
{%- if closures != blank and hours != blank -%}
- {{ 'llms.closed' | t }}: {{ closures }}
{% endif -%}
{%- if admission != blank -%}
- {{ 'llms.admission' | t }}: {{ admission }}
{% endif -%}
- [{{ 'llms.visit_more' | t }}]({{ site }}/pages/plan-your-visit)

{{ 'llms.hours_note' | t }}

